# Allowlist (ARCH §19.2): everything is ignored except the entries below.
# Folders are written without a trailing slash: the Vercel CLI asks the rules about a folder by its bare name
# ("api", not "api/"), so "!api/" never keeps the folder and its files are left out of the upload (spike S1).
/*
!api
!server
!public
!content
!scripts
!db
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!vercel.json
